    ["5231262   隐秘空间-恶魔酒吧   单人位面"] = "5231262 Secret Space - Demon Bar Single-Player Instance",
    ["5月26日\n　　激动？幸福？紧张？我无法用任何语言和文字描述现在的心情。\n我和尼尔登顶了！\n　　尼尔很幸运，找到一颗琥珀，这将作为他的登顶纪念。我也学着他在山上找，不过没什么特别的。最后我将山顶的雪混了些土，装到瓶子里。\n\n下山物资：\n面包2份\n肉干和肉肠1份\n糖1罐\n黄油1块\n水2瓶"] = "May 26th\n　　Excited? Happy? Nervous? I cannot describe my current mood with any language or words.\nNeil and I reached the summit!\n　　Neil was lucky and found an amber, which will serve as his summit souvenir. I also tried to look for one on the mountain like him, but there was nothing special. In the end, I mixed some soil with the snow from the summit and put it in a bottle.\n\nSupplies for the descent:\nBread: 2 portions\nDried meat and sausages: 1 portion\nSugar: 1 jar\nButter: 1 block\nWater: 2 bottles",
