    ["<P_Heart>（耸肩）</>习惯了。十九岁失去家人后，我就和死亡绑在一起了。与其假装自己还能当个普通人，不如活成收尸人途径的非凡者该有的样子。"] = "<P_Heart>(Shrugging)</> I'm used to it. After losing my family at nineteen, I was tied to death. Rather than pretending I could still be an ordinary person, it's better to live as a Beyonder of the Corpse Collector pathway should.",
