    ["黑麦啤酒1便士一杯，恩马特啤酒2便士，南威尔啤酒4便士。"] = "Rye beer is 1 penny a glass, Enmat beer is 2 pennies, Southwell beer is 4 pennies.",
    ["（一）\n　　我们是5月23日上午上山的，上山的时候碰到了一个穿着整齐西装的男人，四十来岁的样子，他向我们询问下山的路，给我感觉像城堡里的伯爵先生一样，佐治将下山的路告诉给他。没走两步，我回头，他消失不见了。\n　　佐治说要学习搭帐篷，我给他示范了三次，最后反倒是我被帐篷难倒了，这新买的帐篷不太顶用。"] = "(I)\n　　We went up the mountain on the morning of May 23rd. On the way up, we met a man in a neat suit, looking to be in his forties. He asked us for the way down the mountain. He gave me the feeling of a Count in a castle. George told him the way down. We hadn't walked two steps when I turned back, and he had disappeared.\n　　George said he wanted to learn how to set up a tent. I demonstrated it to him three times, but in the end, I was the one stumped by the tent. This newly bought tent isn't very reliable.",
